WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.201 line:92%
-Michael, how are you doing?

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:02.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm doing great.
How are you, Seth?

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:04.604 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm doing very well.
We've talked to a lot of peopl

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:07.040 align:start size:94% position:6%
over the last six months
who have been self-isolating

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.643 size:84% position:42%
but you are our first
home-confinement guest.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I want to talk a lot
about the cont--

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm breaking
new grounds for you.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You are.
You're a trailblazer.

00:00:16.416 --> 00:00:18.151 size:75% position:38%
I want to talk about
the book's content,

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:20.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
but I'm also sort of fascinate
by the process,

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you did write this boo
in prison.

00:00:22.155 --> 00:00:25.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
Was that a conducive place
to the writing process?

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:27.794 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, more importantly,
did your fellow inmates know

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:29.863 line:92%
you were working on a book

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:33.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, the answer
to both questions is, yes.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.234 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was conducive.

00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:36.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was working at
the sewer treatment plant.

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:40.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there was a lot of
free time, believe it or not

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:44.210 size:81% position:41%
so I would put myself
into the electric room

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.211 size:81% position:41% line:92%
that had a small desk,

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.448 size:84% position:42%
and, on a yellow pad,
I would begin to write.

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:49.916 line:92%
And at the end of each day

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.953
I would sit down with a grou
of the -- my friends, inmates,

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:57.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
like Tony Meatballs
and Andy Cucumbers

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:01.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Stevie and Herbie
and a whole group of guys,

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
and we would get together
in a cube.

00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.433 line:92%
Usually it was mine, cube 28

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.134 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they would come
for a reading,

00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:10.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I would read them
different parts of the boo

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.871 size:81% position:41% line:92%
that I was working on,

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:15.875 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was just something
that we did to pass our time

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.178 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do please,
when you speak to him,

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:20.113 line:92%
give Tony Meatballs my best.

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:22.248 line:92%
And I would also want to ask -

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:25.552
I know you were worried that a
manuscript like this, obviously,

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:27.887
a lot of people wanted
to get their hands on it.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were worried
that it would leak.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.458 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, how do you protect
something like that

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.793
when you're basically, you know,
confined to a place

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:37.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
where you're not in charge
of your own materials, really?

00:01:37.997 --> 00:01:40.400
-You're not in charge of
anything, to be honest with you.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, there was a situation
that took place.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:45.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
I used to keep the manuscrip
under my mattress.

00:01:45.638 --> 00:01:48.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, unfortunately,
there was a little incident,

00:01:48.708 --> 00:01:51.177
and I knew I was going
to be taken to the SHU --

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:55.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
the solitary confinement,
the segregated housing unit.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:58.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was concerned
that the CO's,

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:01.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
most of whom
are Trump supporters,

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:04.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
that somebody would get
ahold of it, see what it was

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:07.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then pass it along
to somebody.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.596 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, so, it was
the day before Passover.

00:02:09.596 --> 00:02:13.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
And outside was the rabbi.
He had the fire pit.

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:15.135 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And normally you burn

00:02:15.135 --> 00:02:18.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
the chametz, the bread,
the night before.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:19.839 line:92%
And I took my manuscript,

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:24.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I dropped it into the
fire pit to everybody's anger,

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:25.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but I did it anyway

00:02:25.512 --> 00:02:28.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I had to get rid
of the manuscript.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.850 size:81% position:41%
-I bet you're probably
one of the few people

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:35.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
that has used Passover
for that purpose, Michael.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.390 line:92%
A trailblazer in another way

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.925 line:92%
-Go, Passover. [ Laughs ]

00:02:38.925 --> 00:02:41.661 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, Michael, we --
Our show interacted with you

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:43.863 size:81% position:41%
back in the early days
of the Trump campaign

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:47.500
because we were in conversations
about having him on as a guest

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:49.035 size:84% position:42%
And one of the things
that you reached out --

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:51.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Seth, can you believe --
Seth, can you believe

00:02:51.638 --> 00:02:53.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
that was five years ago?
-I truly can't.

00:02:53.773 --> 00:02:57.110
I can't decide if it feels lik
yesterday or 1,000 years ago

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
though, because time
is folding in on itself.

00:02:59.612 --> 00:03:01.381 align:start size:94% position:6%
-For me,
it doesn't seem the same.

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:03.082 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, for me,
it doesn't seem the same.

00:03:03.082 --> 00:03:04.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
A lot's happened for me
over five years.

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, exactly. You probably
didn't picture yourself

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.255 align:start size:94% position:6%
working in
a sewage treatment unit.

00:03:09.255 --> 00:03:12.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Well, I went from
one crap house to another.

00:03:12.125 --> 00:03:14.427 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Very well-played.
-Thank you.

00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:15.595 line:92%
-By the way, I'm shocked to hear

00:03:15.595 --> 00:03:17.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
that working there
you have a lot of downtime

00:03:17.564 --> 00:03:18.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
I guess that's one
of the upsides

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:21.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
of working
in a sewage treatment unit

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
So -- But I remember
you reached out.

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.206 align:start size:94% position:6%
One of the preconditions
you had about --

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.341 size:88% position:44%
Or one of Donald Trump's
preconditions was that

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would have to apologize
for jokes I made

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.411 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the White House
Correspondents' Dinner.

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'm wondering if,
in your time working for him

00:03:33.947 --> 00:03:38.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
you often had to reach out
on behalf of his ego

00:03:38.418 --> 00:03:42.121 line:92%
when speaking on his behalf.

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:43.356 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-On a regular basis.

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:46.092 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was unfortunately
on a very regular basis.

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:49.329
And thank you for at least
acknowledging that it was hi

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:54.167
directing me to do it,
not me deciding to do it.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:56.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You -- You know,
it's interesting you say that,

00:03:56.069 --> 00:03:59.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
as well, because in the book
to your credit,

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:03.309 align:start size:94% position:6%
you do admit to taking
a very active role.

00:04:03.309 --> 00:04:05.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were not just
a passive bystander.

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:08.581
You were, yes, following orders,
but you knew they were

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:12.318 size:88% position:44%
the wrong thing to do,
and you did them anyway.

00:04:12.318 --> 00:04:13.853 line:92%
You speak about Trump supporters

00:04:13.853 --> 00:04:17.156
and the sort of whole Trum
world as being like a cult

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:20.126 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're obviously
not in that cult anymore,

00:04:20.126 --> 00:04:22.195 line:92%
but you sort of exited the cul

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:24.864 align:start size:94% position:6%
because of the legal situation
you were in.

00:04:24.864 --> 00:04:26.833 align:start size:94% position:6%
Had that broken differently,
had you not had

00:04:26.833 --> 00:04:29.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
those legal troubles,
do you think it's possible

00:04:29.269 --> 00:04:32.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
you would still be
in the Trump cult?

00:04:32.171 --> 00:04:33.439 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-It's very possible.

00:04:33.439 --> 00:04:35.675 align:start size:94% position:6%
I can't give you
the answer to that

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:37.477 align:start size:94% position:6%
because I can only speak
from fact.

00:04:37.477 --> 00:04:42.148
And the fact of the matter i
I was, for an interesting term

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:45.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
excommunicated
from the Trump cult,

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:47.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
not on my own volition,
as you stated,

00:04:47.654 --> 00:04:49.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
whether it was
the legal proceeding

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:52.158 size:88% position:44% line:92%
or Trump and his cronies

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:54.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
deciding that I should be
the fall guy.

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:55.495 size:81% position:41% line:92%
But it's very possible

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:57.830 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I would still have been
in that cult.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:59.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
I am --
It's the one thankful thin

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:02.101 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I am for everything
that has happened.

00:05:02.101 --> 00:05:06.039 size:88% position:44%
It's given me an ability
to amend with my wife,

00:05:06.039 --> 00:05:07.707 size:75% position:38% line:92%
my daughter, my son,

00:05:07.707 --> 00:05:09.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
and actually the country,
to make amends.

00:05:09.776 --> 00:05:12.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When we come back after
the break, I do want to talk

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:15.381 size:88% position:44%
about some of the things
that you sort of admit

00:05:15.381 --> 00:05:18.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
to having a great amount
of regret for now.

00:05:18.451 --> 00:05:24.657
But I did -- I did appreciat
that you admit to the fact

00:05:24.657 --> 00:05:26.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
you did not have
a "come to Jesus" moment here.

00:05:26.959 --> 00:05:28.227 line:92%
You were sort of kicked out,

00:05:28.227 --> 00:05:30.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was then
that you reflected back.

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:32.965 line:92%
And it is nice to read a boo

00:05:32.965 --> 00:05:36.569 align:start size:94% position:6%
where there aren't
a ton of excuses.

00:05:36.569 --> 00:05:39.772
And when we come back, we're
going to talk more about that.

00:05:39.772 --> 00:05:43.710 align:start size:94% position:6%
We'll be right back
with more from Michael Cohen

